00:00.250 --> 00:02.800
Daksha, a quick look
Recorded from the app, with made-up sample entries. Typing is sped up.

00:03.700 --> 00:08.400
Step 1 of 7: Start at Home
Ask anything, or pick what you want to do today.

00:08.500 --> 00:14.400
Step 2 of 7: Ask in plain words
Type a question about your life, or tap a suggestion.

00:14.500 --> 00:23.400
Step 3 of 7: Write a day
A few lines about what happened. It is saved when you press Save entry.

00:23.500 --> 00:33.400
Step 4 of 7: See what Daksha knows
Open any entry to see what Daksha learned. Every memory shows where it came from.

00:33.500 --> 00:41.800
Step 5 of 7: Talk, and say yes first
Anything that leaves Daksha waits for your yes.

00:41.900 --> 00:47.200
Step 6 of 7: Connect your apps
Mail and calendar show example data in this demo.

00:47.300 --> 00:55.500
Step 7 of 7: Make it yours
Make someone to talk to, and pick your reminders.

00:56.950 --> 01:00.400
Daksha. A friendly assistant that remembers your life.
